Nominations for the 1998 Excellence in Holography Awards may be submitted to the International Hologram Manufacturers Association, the IHMA, through October 9th, 1998.

157
00:16:48,760 --> 00:16:56,600
Winners will be announced at the 9th annual Holopack Holoprint Awards dinner on November 11th, 1998 in Rome, Italy.

158
00:16:56,600 --> 00:17:09,800
Each year, IHMA, the Worldwide Association of the Holography Industry, and Reconnaissance International publisher of holography news combine to recognize the outstanding commercial uses of holography from the previous year.

159
00:17:09,800 --> 00:17:25,400
Any organization involved in the production of the holographic project may apply for an award in one of the following categories new hologram product, authentication product, most novel use of holograms, and purposed designed holograms.

160
00:17:25,400 --> 00:17:32,200
Nomination forms may be obtained from IHMA's Denver, Colorado, or London, England offices.

161
00:17:32,200 --> 00:17:40,440
And if you have a pencil and paper already, I will give you the ways to contact this uh organization in just a few minutes.

162
00:17:40,440 --> 00:17:51,360
Last year's winners included the New York Times and Light Vision Confections for their holographic lollipop, which received best of year, used as a premium to launch the New Times Color Edition.

163
00:17:51,600 --> 00:18:01,120
Campbell Soup and Van Lear Metalized Products won most novel use for their collectible spaghetti o labels with holographic scenes from Johnny Quest.

164
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:09,440
Hologram Industries Holo C I S project took honors as an excellent new vehicle identification system used in France.

165
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:20,080
And American Express and OPSEC were commended for their use of special holograms, and in parentheses it has Excelgrams to stop counterfeiting of travelers' checks.

166
00:18:20,080 --> 00:18:27,840
The IHMA has already received a number of innovative submissions and encourages any company working with holograms to apply.

167
00:18:27,840 --> 00:18:36,320
Nominees must sign a statement vouching that they have complied with the IHMA's code of conduct, including respecting the copyrights of all parties.

168
00:18:36,320 --> 00:18:38,160
There is no cost to apply.

169
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:49,440
The winning submissions will be on display at the Holopac Holoprint Conference at the Cavallari Hilton in Rome, Italy, and will be shown at several trade shows through 1999.

170
00:18:49,440 --> 00:18:57,360
The IHMA is an association of more than 60 of the world's leading hologram producers working together to advance the interests of the industry.

171
00:18:57,360 --> 00:19:05,120
One of its foremost achievements is the hologram image register, a hologram registry that protects security holograms from being copied.

